              Tom Fox,
              = succeed "." do
                %em The construction of cofree coalgebras
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.mcgill.ca/fox/papers.html"} texfile here
          %p but note that this contains an error which is corrected in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michiel+Hazewinkel"} Michiel Hazewinkel
              (2003), “Cofree coalgebras and multivariable recursiveness”,
